  "repo_truth": "The 30-entry subject contains the exact P4/P5 fixtures, tests, definitions, unchanged generic runtime anchors, and coupled authority/proof records. Default P4 result: 3 passed, 1 ignored. Default P5 result: 12 passed, 1 ignored. Each new negative regression passes. Each ignored positive mutation test fails under --ignored at intake_append with Store and detail generic lineage store refused: intake output tuple is not exact or unique. HCM-2.3 registration kernel is 16 passed; the existing generic promotion/recovery selector is 1 passed; cargo fmt check and git diff check exit 0. P4 and P5 completion are not asserted.",
  "allowed_scope": [
    "Read-only replay of all 30 manifest entries and the exact P4/P5 stop-record diff.",
    "Independently trace released coverage IDs through intake_commit_plan token derivation, valid_intake_value_token, and validate_output_contract.",
    "Verify the default-green negative regressions and explicitly ignored positive tests preserve the blocker without waiving required P4/P5 proof.",
    "Verify SPEC, plan, todo, manifest, decision, and P4/P5 proof records agree that P4/P5 remain incomplete and P6 remains closed.",
    "Assess whether the proposed future normalization direction is clearly non-authorizing, bounded, collision-aware, and does not weaken the lineage grammar or released definitions.",
    "Identify findings independently before comparing P3/P4 advisory candidates with 09."
  ],
  "non_goals": [
    "No edits, formatting, staging, commit, push, handoff, ledger, dispatch, or delegation.",
    "No runtime correction, token normalization, token-grammar widening, released-definition edit, P2/P3/P6 implementation, completion claim, or sibling-slice work.",
    "Do not treat a clean review of the truthful stop record as resolution of the known P4/P5 runtime prerequisite."
  ],
  "tasks": [
    "Verify complete subject identity and inspect the exact stop-record/test delta.",
    "Replay the two default-green targets, exact negative regressions, and explicit ignored-positive failures as needed.",
    "Trace the failure through live code and determine whether fixture-only remediation is impossible.",
    "Validate cross-document consistency, proof honesty, selector compliance, and the retained P2 blocker that keeps P6 closed.",
    "Return findings first in Critical, Required, Optional, Nit order with exact file/line, violated contract, why wrong, smallest remediation, and missing verification."
  ],
  "contracts_and_gates": [
    "P4/P5 unchanged generic HCM-2.3 mutation requirement remains unsatisfied",
    "Default-green negative regression does not replace positive mutation/promotion proof",
    "No runtime or released-definition edit is authorized",
